atures\uff1a</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shin Honkaku Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cthulhu Detective</strong> expands the possibilities of deduction games by integrating supernatural elements with authentic cases, pushing the joy of solving mysteries to the <strong>NEXT LEVEL</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even Crimes Committed by Gods Leave Traces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fictional near-modern world touched by subtle Cthulhu mythos \u2014a mysterious world where humans and gods coexist. The shadowy <strong>AIB</strong> (Agency of Investigating the Bizarre), containing and safeguarding unknown <strong>artifacts</strong>\u2014lost relics of gods and forbidden powers. Meanwhile, in the city's darkest corners, desperate souls whisper about obtaining supernatural abilities. As a rookie investigator, you'll untangle this web of mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>400,000 Words of Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a sprawling narrative where intricate cases collide with unforgettable characters\u2014every clue matters, every word counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But can you trust everything you see?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Paths to Catch the Killer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of being stuck searching for that &quot;one last piece of evidence&quot;? <i>Cthulhu Detective</i> breaks free from rigid investigative structures. We offers a more flexible system that combines evidence collection and deduction seamlessly. Investigate the scene, connect the clues, and deduce at your own pace. Each case offers multiple solutions, allowing you to unravel the truth through different reasoning routes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Battlecr